window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>The tantalizingly thrilling 365 Days series comes to a close with this passionate finale as Laura and Massimo start their life together. </b><b> </b><br><br>Laura Biel’s new life in Sicily looks like the perfect fairy tale: a decadent wedding, a wealthy and devoted husband, a baby on the way, and lavish luxury complete with servants, extravagant cars, and seaside palazzos. <br> <br>Yes, all of this would be perfect, except for the fact that Laura is constantly surrounded by gangsters as the threat of her kidnapping looms large. Laura is about to finally discover what it means to be married to the most dangerous man in Italy."; 
